---
import type { Locale } from '../../i18n';
import { localePath } from '../../i18n';
import { openEvoHarness2Qualification as q } from '../../data/openEvoHarness2Qualification';

interface Props { locale: Locale }
const { locale } = Astro.props;
const zh = locale === 'zh';
const t = (cn:string,en:string) => zh ? cn : en;
const p = (path:string) => localePath(locale,path);
const parentHref = p('/research/seed-openevo/study/capability-exploration/openevo-2-0/');
const controlInvalidPct = q.control.invalidTerminatedRate * 100;
const candidateInvalidPct = q.candidate.invalidTerminatedRate * 100;
const formatDeltaPp = (q.candidate.formatInvalidRate - q.control.formatInvalidRate) * 100;
const stateDeltaPp = (q.candidate.stateInadmissibleRate - q.control.stateInadmissibleRate) * 100;
const semanticDeltaPp = (q.candidate.semanticInvalidRate - q.control.semanticInvalidRate) * 100;
---

<main class="h2study" data-testid="harness2-mini-study">
  <nav class="h2study__back" aria-label={t('OpenEVO 2.0 研究导航','OpenEVO 2.0 research navigation')}>
    <a href={parentHref}>← {t('返回 OpenEVO 2.0','Back to OpenEVO 2.0')}</a>
  </nav>

  <header class="h2study__hero">
    <div>
      <p>OPENEVO 2.0 · MINI STUDY 01</p>
      <h1>{t('Harness 2.0 迷你实验','Harness 2.0 mini study')}</h1>
      <strong>{t('安全门通过，但还不能进入正式 Stage 2。','The safety gate passed, but formal Stage 2 is still on hold.')}</strong>
      <span>{t('我们用同一个 3B 起点、同一批已经消费过的训练题和同一套采样规则，比较“完全不注入 carrier”与“注入 interface-safe Harness 2.0”。这次实验不是为了挑高分版本，而是先确认新的 harness 会不会把动作接口搞坏。','Using the same 3B starting point, the same already-consumed training tasks, and the same sampling rules, we paired a no-carrier control against the interface-safe Harness 2.0 candidate. This was not a score-selection experiment; it first asked whether the new harness damages the action interface.')}</span>
    </div>
    <aside aria-label={t('实验结论','Study decision')}>
      <span>QUALIFICATION</span>
      <strong>{q.mechanicalStatus}</strong>
      <small>{t('预注册的接口健康检查全部过线','All preregistered interface-health checks passed')}</small>
      <span>V1 FORMAL ACTIVATION</span>
      <strong>HOLD</strong>
      <small>{t('这是 Mini Study 01 当时的 v1 closeout；后续 2.0.1 mechanical qualification 已经 PASS。','This is the v1 closeout from Mini Study 01; the later 2.0.1 mechanical qualification has since passed.')}</small>
      <span>2.0.1 FOLLOW-UP</span>
      <strong>MECHANICAL PASS</strong>
      <small>{t('Scientific closeout = HOLD_FOR_STAGE2_READINESS_AUDIT；formal_stage2_authorized=false。','Scientific closeout = HOLD_FOR_STAGE2_READINESS_AUDIT; formal_stage2_authorized=false.')}</small>
    </aside>
  </header>

  <section class="h2study__section" aria-labelledby="question-title">
    <p class="kicker">RESEARCH QUESTION</p>
    <h2 id="question-title">{t('旧 carrier 真的是 3B 大量非法动作的主要原因吗？','Were the old carriers really the main cause of 3B invalid actions?')}</h2>
    <p>{t('Ceiling-1.0 的 3B 长期保持 0 条完整成功轨迹，而且大量 episode 因动作接口问题提前结束。我们怀疑旧 harness 每一步同时塞入 Text Memory、Skill 和 Agent System，历史经验里的动作表达会压过当前页面。Harness 2.0 因此先做了职责分离、Context Governor、Telemetry v2 和 interface-safe carrier。','Ceiling-1.0 3B remained at zero exact-success trajectories while many episodes terminated early at the action interface. We suspected that injecting Text Memory, Skill, and Agent System together on every step let historical action language overwhelm the live page. Harness 2.0 therefore introduced role separation, a Context Governor, Telemetry v2, and interface-safe carriers.')}</p>

    <figure class="h2study__flow" aria-label={t('同一 3B 起点分成 control 与 Harness 2.0 两个配对实验','The same 3B starting point branches into control and Harness 2.0 paired cells')}>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 1000 330" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
        <defs><marker id="h2-arrow" markerWidth="9" markerHeight="9" refX="8" refY="4.5" orient="auto"><path d="M0,0 L9,4.5 L0,9 Z" /></marker></defs>
        <path d="M245 165 C330 165 340 82 430 82" />
        <path d="M245 165 C330 165 340 248 430 248" />
      </svg>
      <article class="h2study__flow-node h2study__flow-source"><span>SHARED</span><strong>{t('同一个 3B Stage-1 / OPSD 起点','Same 3B Stage-1 / OPSD state')}</strong><small>{t(`训练位置 ${q.window} · temperature ${q.temperature}`,`training positions ${q.window} · temperature ${q.temperature}`)}</small></article>
      <article class="h2study__flow-node h2study__flow-control"><span>CONTROL</span><strong>{t('不注入 carrier','No carrier injection')}</strong><small>128 / 128</small><p>{t('保留相同 parser、任务、seed、horizon 和采样。','Same parser, tasks, seeds, horizon, and sampling.')}</p></article>
      <article class="h2study__flow-node h2study__flow-candidate"><span>CANDIDATE</span><strong>Harness 2.0</strong><small>128 / 128</small><p>{t('使用经过 linter 与职责分离的 interface-safe carrier。','Uses interface-safe carriers that passed lint and role separation.')}</p></article>
      <figcaption>{t(`两边 formal task consumption = ${q.formalTaskConsumption}，final panel access = ${q.finalPanelAccess}。这批训练位置已经被正式训练消费过，因此资格实验没有偷看最终考试。`,`Formal task consumption = ${q.formalTaskConsumption} and final-panel access = ${q.finalPanelAccess} for both cells. These positions had already been consumed by formal training, so qualification did not inspect the final exam.`)}</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </section>

  <section class="h2study__section" aria-labelledby="result-title">
    <p class="kicker">PAIRED RESULT</p>
    <h2 id="result-title">{t('机械 PASS，不等于行为变好','Mechanical PASS did not mean better behavior')}</h2>
    <p>{t('预注册 gate 只要求新 harness 不出现超过容忍线的接口退化，因此它机械上 PASS。但在这组 128 对 128 的配对轨迹里，Harness 2.0 反而多出现了非法终止。这个行为信号足够让我们暂停正式激活。','The preregistered gate only required the new harness to stay within interface-regression tolerances, so it mechanically passed. But on these paired 128-versus-128 traces, Harness 2.0 produced more invalid terminations. That behavior signal was enough to hold formal activation.')}</p>

    <div class="h2study__bars" role="img" aria-label={t('Control 与 Harness 2.0 非法终止比例比较','Invalid-termination comparison for Control and Harness 2.0')}>
      <div><span>Control</span><div><i style={`width:${controlInvalidPct}%`}></i></div><b>{controlInvalidPct.toFixed(2)}%</b></div>
      <div><span>Harness 2.0</span><div><i style={`width:${candidateInvalidPct}%`}></i></div><b>{candidateInvalidPct.toFixed(2)}%</b></div>
    </div>

    <div class="h2study__table-wrap">
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>{t('指标','Metric')}</th><th>Control</th><th>Harness 2.0</th><th>{t('变化','Delta')}</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><th>{t('因非法输出提前结束的 episode','Invalid-terminated episodes')}</th><td>40 / 128 · 31.25%</td><td>54 / 128 · 42.19%</td><td>+10.94 pp</td></tr>
          <tr><th>{t('格式错误 step','Format-invalid steps')}</th><td>28 / 1621 · 1.73%</td><td>37 / 1479 · 2.50%</td><td>+{formatDeltaPp.toFixed(2)} pp</td></tr>
          <tr><th>{t('命令语义错误 step','Semantic-invalid steps')}</th><td>10 / 1621 · 0.62%</td><td>4 / 1479 · 0.27%</td><td>{semanticDeltaPp.toFixed(2)} pp</td></tr>
          <tr><th>{t('当前页面不可执行 step','State-inadmissible steps')}</th><td>2 / 1621 · 0.12%</td><td>13 / 1479 · 0.88%</td><td>+{stateDeltaPp.toFixed(2)} pp</td></tr>
          <tr><th>{t('有部分分数的 episode','Positive-score episodes')}</th><td>2 / 128</td><td>0 / 128</td><td>−2</td></tr>
          <tr><th>{t('完整成功','Exact success')}</th><td>0 / 128</td><td>0 / 128</td><td>0</td></tr>
          <tr><th>{t('平均 Task Score','Mean Task Score')}</th><td>{q.control.meanScore.toFixed(5)}</td><td>{q.candidate.meanScore.toFixed(5)}</td><td>−{q.control.meanScore.toFixed(5)}</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="h2study__paired">
      <article><span>{q.paired.bothInvalid}</span><strong>{t('两边都非法终止','invalid in both')}</strong></article>
      <article><span>{q.paired.controlOnlyInvalid}</span><strong>{t('只有 Control 非法','control only')}</strong></article>
      <article class="warn"><span>{q.paired.candidateOnlyInvalid}</span><strong>{t('只有 Harness2 非法','Harness2 only')}</strong></article>
      <article><span>{q.paired.neitherInvalid}</span><strong>{t('两边都没有非法终止','invalid in neither')}</strong></article>
    </div>
    <p class="h2study__boundary">{t('这组结果说明“在这 128 个配对轨迹上 Harness 2.0 行为更差”，但不能单独证明 Harness 2.0 在所有训练窗口都会更差。它足以支持 HOLD 和小修，不足以支持永久放弃这个方向。','This panel shows worse Harness 2.0 behavior on these 128 paired traces, but it does not prove Harness 2.0 would be worse on every training window. It is enough to justify HOLD plus a small repair, not abandonment of the direction.')}</p>
  </section>

  <section class="h2study__section" aria-labelledby="mechanism-title">
    <p class="kicker">MECHANISM EVIDENCE</p>
    <h2 id="mechanism-title">{t('三组诊断信号','Three diagnostic signals appeared together')}</h2>
    <div class="h2study__mechanisms">
      <article>
        <span>01</span><strong>{t('Prompt 与 parser 的语言规则没对齐','Prompt/parser language contract mismatch')}</strong>
        <p>{t(`Control 的 ${q.mechanisms.chineseFormatInvalid.control}/${q.mechanisms.chineseFormatInvalid.control} 个格式错误、Harness2 的 ${q.mechanisms.chineseFormatInvalid.candidate}/${q.mechanisms.chineseFormatInvalid.candidate} 个格式错误都包含中文。parser 会拒绝中文，但 compact prompt 没有明确要求全英文。Harness2 让这种 code-switch 更频繁，但 control 本身已经有同一问题。`,`All ${q.mechanisms.chineseFormatInvalid.control} control format failures and all ${q.mechanisms.chineseFormatInvalid.candidate} Harness2 format failures contain Chinese. The parser rejects Chinese, while the compact prompt never explicitly requires English-only output. Harness2 increases the failure frequency, but the same mismatch already exists in control.`)}</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <span>02</span><strong>{t('抽象动作词又被 3B 当成按钮','Abstract action words became pseudo-buttons')}</strong>
        <p>{t('我们删除了历史按钮字面量，但保留了 pagination、return-to-search 这类动作名；轨迹里随后出现 click[pagination] 等伪动作。这与“抽象动作词可能被模型重新当成可点击目标”的解释一致，但这里没有单独做词汇消融，所以不能把它写成已经证实的因果原因。','Historical button literals were removed, but action-like nouns such as pagination and return-to-search remained; the traces then included pseudo-actions such as click[pagination]. That is consistent with the hypothesis that action-like abstractions can be reinterpreted as clickable targets, but vocabulary was not isolated in its own ablation, so this is not a proven causal explanation.')}</p>
        <code>{q.mechanisms.pseudoActions.slice(0,2).join(' · ')}</code>
      </article>
      <article>
        <span>03</span><strong>{t('Context Governor 没有达到预定的 selective / thin 设计','The Context Governor did not meet the intended selective/thin design')}</strong>
        <p>{t(`同一个 step 0，Control 平均 ${q.control.step0MeanInputTokens.toFixed(2)} tokens，Harness2 平均 ${q.candidate.step0MeanInputTokens.toFixed(2)} tokens，固定多 ${q.mechanisms.step0TokenDelta} tokens；Harness2 的 1,479 个 step 每一步都同时注入 Memory + Skill + Agent。因此它没有实现预定的 selective / thin 输入策略。这个 token 差异能证明设计没有按目标变薄，但不能单独证明它造成了非法动作增加。`,`On the same step 0, Control averaged ${q.control.step0MeanInputTokens.toFixed(2)} tokens while Harness2 averaged ${q.candidate.step0MeanInputTokens.toFixed(2)}, a fixed +${q.mechanisms.step0TokenDelta}-token delta; every one of Harness2's 1,479 steps still injected Memory + Skill + Agent together. This shows that the implementation did not meet the intended selective/thin design, but token inflation alone does not prove that it caused the higher invalid-termination rate.`)}</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="h2study__section" aria-labelledby="decision-title">
    <p class="kicker">DECISION</p>
    <h2 id="decision-title">{t('Harness 2.0 方向保留，v1 暂不激活','Keep the Harness 2.0 direction; do not activate v1')}</h2>
    <div class="h2study__decision">
      <article class="pass"><span>MECHANICAL</span><strong>PASS</strong><p>{t('128+128 完整、工程无效为 0、carrier lint / role separation / budget / readback 与预注册接口容忍线都通过。','128+128 completed with zero engineering-invalid rows; carrier lint, role separation, budget, readback, and preregistered interface tolerances all passed.')}</p></article>
      <article class="hold"><span>SCIENTIFIC</span><strong>HOLD</strong><p>{t('行为没有改善，而且 candidate-only invalid 明显更多；因此不创建 formal activation，也不把这次 PASS 写成“可以开始正式 Stage2”。','Behavior did not improve and candidate-only invalid terminations were clearly more frequent; therefore no formal activation is created, and PASS is not treated as permission to begin formal Stage 2.')}</p></article>
    </div>
    <p>{t('同时，Control 自己已经有 31.25% 非法终止、0/128 完整成功。因此“所有问题都由 carrier 内容单独造成”这个解释不成立。剩余失败仍可能来自共享 prompt / parser / action contract、基础 policy，或这些因素之间的交互；这组 128 次 control 不能继续把责任归到“3B 本身”。','At the same time, Control itself has 31.25% invalid termination and 0/128 exact success. That rules out the explanation that carrier content alone accounts for every failure. The remaining errors could still arise from the shared prompt/parser/action contract, the base policy, or interactions among them; this 128-attempt control does not isolate responsibility to “3B itself”.')}</p>
  </section>

  <section class="h2study__section" aria-labelledby="next-title">
    <p class="kicker">HARNESS 2.0.1 · FOLLOW-UP</p>
    <h2 id="next-title">{t('这四项是 v1 closeout 当时冻结的 2.0.1 计划；后续机械资格已经 PASS','These four items were the frozen 2.0.1 plan from the v1 closeout; the later mechanical qualification is now PASS')}</h2>
    <p>{t('Mini Study 01 的 v1 结果保持原样，不把后来的 2.0.1 paired metrics 倒写进旧实验。这里另外同步 2.0.1 的后续状态：mechanical qualification = PASS；scientific closeout = HOLD_FOR_STAGE2_READINESS_AUDIT；下一阶段 = STAGE2_READINESS_AUDIT_AND_DRESS_REHEARSAL。','The Mini Study 01 v1 result remains unchanged; later 2.0.1 paired metrics are not backfilled into the old study. This section separately reports the 2.0.1 follow-up state: mechanical qualification = PASS; scientific closeout = HOLD_FOR_STAGE2_READINESS_AUDIT; next phase = STAGE2_READINESS_AUDIT_AND_DRESS_REHEARSAL.')}</p>
    <ol class="h2study__next">
      <li><span>01</span><div><strong>{t('共享 prompt 明确 English-only','Make the shared prompt explicitly English-only')}</strong><p>{t('Control 与 Harness2 一起改；parser 不放宽。','Change both Control and Harness2; do not relax the parser.')}</p></div></li>
      <li><span>02</span><div><strong>{t('Context Governor 真正变薄','Make the Context Governor genuinely thin')}</strong><p>{t('不再每一步同时注入 Memory + Skill + Agent；保留小型全局 authority，只提供当前最相关的非全局经验。','Stop injecting Memory + Skill + Agent on every step; keep a tiny global authority policy and only the minimal relevant non-global context.')}</p></div></li>
      <li><span>03</span><div><strong>{t('禁止 action-like abstraction vocabulary','Remove action-like abstraction vocabulary')}</strong><p>{t('不仅禁具体按钮，也不直接暴露 pagination / return-to-search 这类容易被 3B 当作按钮名的词。','Ban not only literal buttons but also pseudo-action nouns such as pagination and return-to-search that 3B may reinterpret as button names.')}</p></div></li>
      <li><span>04</span><div><strong>{t('v1 closeout 当时计划：换一个全新的资格窗口','v1 closeout plan: use a fresh qualification window')}</strong><p>{t(`v1 closeout 当时规定：位置 ${q.window} 已经看过结果，不能再拿来选择 2.0.1；后续 qualification 必须预注册互不重叠、已经被正式训练消费过的 training window。`,`The v1 closeout specified that positions ${q.window} had already been inspected and could not select 2.0.1; the follow-up qualification had to preregister a disjoint training window already consumed by formal training.`)}</p></div></li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <details class="h2study__evidence">
    <summary>{t('证据与复现边界','Evidence and reproduction boundary')}</summary>
    <div class="h2study__evidence-grid">
      <div><span>{t('正式 receipt','Canonical receipt')}</span><a href={q.evidence.receipt} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">qualification-receipt.json ↗</a></div>
      <div><span>{t('研究 closeout','Research closeout')}</span><a href={q.evidence.closeout} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Harness 2.0 preformal closeout ↗</a></div>
      <div><span>{t('实验代码快照','Experiment code snapshot')}</span><a href={q.evidence.commit} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">openevo-experiment@{q.evidenceCommit.slice(0,8)} ↗</a></div>
      <div><span>Receipt SHA256</span><code>{q.receiptSha256}</code></div>
      <div><span>{t('分析代码 SHA','Analysis code SHA')}</span><code>{q.analysisGitSha}</code></div>
      <div><span>{t('选择边界','Selection boundary')}</span><strong>{t('reward / success 不参与机械 PASS/FAIL；final panel 未访问','reward / success did not select mechanical PASS/FAIL; final panel stayed locked')}</strong></div>
    </div>
  </details>
</main>

<style>
.h2study{width:min(1120px,calc(100% - 2rem));margin:0 auto 4rem;color:var(--color-text)}
.h2study__back{padding:1rem 0 .25rem}.h2study__back a{color:var(--color-accent);font-size:.72rem;font-weight:760;text-decoration:none}.h2study__back a:hover{text-decoration:underline}
.h2study__hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.35fr) minmax(250px,.65fr);gap:1.5rem;align-items:end;padding:1.4rem 0 2rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-border)}.h2study__hero>div>p,.kicker{margin:0 0 .55rem;color:var(--color-accent);font:800 .62rem/1.3 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;letter-spacing:.09em}.h2study__hero h1{margin:0;font-size:clamp(2.3rem,6vw,4.8rem);line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.055em}.h2study__hero>div>strong{display:block;margin-top:.9rem;font-size:clamp(1rem,2vw,1.28rem)}.h2study__hero>div>span{display:block;margin-top:.55rem;max-width:76ch;color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.72}.h2study__hero aside{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;gap:.35rem .7rem;padding:1rem;border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:var(--radius-panel);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--color-accent) 4%,var(--color-bg))}.h2study__hero aside span{color:var(--color-text-muted);font:800 .56rem ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;letter-spacing:.06em}.h2study__hero aside strong{font-size:.82rem}.h2study__hero aside small{grid-column:2;color:var(--color-text-muted);font-size:.68rem;line-height:1.45}
.h2study__section{padding:2.2rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-border)}.h2study__section h2{margin:0;font-size:clamp(1.4rem,3vw,2.35rem);letter-spacing:-.04em}.h2study__section>p{max-width:84ch;color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.7}.h2study__boundary{font-size:.72rem}
.h2study__flow{position:relative;display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(210px,.8fr) minmax(0,1.2fr);grid-template-rows:1fr 1fr;gap:.8rem 3rem;min-height:330px;margin:1.2rem 0 0;padding:1rem;border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:var(--radius-feature);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--color-text) 1.4%,transparent)}.h2study__flow svg{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;z-index:0}.h2study__flow svg path{fill:none;stroke:color-mix(in srgb,var(--color-accent) 58%,var(--color-border));stroke-width:2.4;marker-end:url(#h2-arrow)}.h2study__flow svg marker path{fill:var(--color-accent);stroke:none}.h2study__flow-node{position:relative;z-index:1;align-self:center;padding:1rem;border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:var(--radius-panel);background:var(--color-bg)}.h2study__flow-node span,.h2study__flow-node strong,.h2study__flow-node small{display:block}.h2study__flow-node span{color:var(--color-accent);font:800 .56rem ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;letter-spacing:.07em}.h2study__flow-node strong{margin:.3rem 0;font-size:.9rem}.h2study__flow-node small{color:var(--color-text-muted);font-size:.62rem}.h2study__flow-node p{margin:.5rem 0 0;color:var(--color-text-muted);font-size:.7rem;line-height:1.5}.h2study__flow-source{grid-row:1/3}.h2study__flow-candidate{border-width:2px;border-color:var(--color-accent)}.h2study__flow figcaption{grid-column:1/-1;position:relative;z-index:1;color:var(--color-text-muted);font-size:.68rem;line-height:1.5}
